<title>JAPAN: Japan panel urges end to magnesium tariff.</title>
<headline>Japan panel urges end to magnesium tariff.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Japanese government advisory body on Wednesday called for the abolition of the country's 5.2 percent import tariff on magnesium in the fiscal year beginning in April 1997.</p>
<p>The Customs Tariff Council's recommendation was announced by the Ministry of Finance.</p>
